{"id":"normalmente","lemma":"normalmente","pos":"adv","rank":1199,"glosses":["normally; usually; most of the time; customarily"],"ipa":"/noɾˈmalˌmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-normalmente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Normalmente no lo haces tú mismo, ¿verdad?","en":"You don't usually do that by yourself, do you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460044","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"same"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"¿Normalmente llegas temprano o tarde?","en":"Are you usually early or late?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460022","words":[null,{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"early, early on"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Normalmente soy yo el que lo hace.","en":"I'm the one who usually does that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611283","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]},{"text":"Normalmente voy andando.","en":"I usually walk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705036","words":[null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to walk, to go","l":"andar"}]},{"text":"Normalmente estoy de acuerdo con ella.","en":"I usually agree with her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39123","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"she"}],"phrases":[[2,5,"according to"]]}]}